				"description_loc"
				{
					"english"		"This launch option starts the main version of Defentrix, a ruthless tower defense game built for players who thrive on strategy, precision, and tactical gameplay. It launches the Defentrix.exe file on Windows and provides direct access to the Standard Edition of the game. Ideal for players who want the core Defentrix experience without additional content or beta features."
